# Everything else is derived or an install-time decision:
# - namespace: pass -n <ns> to the scripts (or set it on your kubectl
#   context) — plain helm workflow, no repo variable
# - PF hostname: <release>-pingfederate-engine.ping-devops.com (ping-devops
#   convention, wildcard TLS on the public nginx controller)
# - issuer/JWKS/audience: derived from that hostname
# - Ping DevOps license: from the cluster's devops-secret or your environment
# Override anything via environment or deploy.sh --set only to deviate.

# AWS region for the agent deployment (agentcore CLI).
AWS_REGION=eu-central-1
